      },
      {
        "id": "monitor_only",
        "description": "Continue monitoring without starting benchmark tasks at this time."
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes_to_user": "If you want, I can start with Step 3 (quota override) and Step 1 (launch batch-refresh-12) right away, followed by Step 2 (API validation). Please confirm which option you prefer."
